      "text": "Found a way to get $125-$200 in FREE ai credits for gpt-5.6 sol, claude opus 5 and opus 4.8 😳\n\nagentrouter is a non-profit version of openrouter. one api key, no card. credits land on your account at signup.\n\nwhat you get for $0:\n-$125-200 in credits on signup (github only)\n-claude opus 5, gpt-5.6 sol, opus 4.8 through one key\n-free models \n-openai-compatible (works with anything)\n\nwhat this replaces:\n-paid frontier API costs for coding agents\n-claude opus 4.8: $15/M in, $75/M out\n-gpt-5.6 sol: $25/M out\n\nhow to grab yours (2 min):\n1. go to http://agentrouter.org/register?aff=Gp3w → sign in with github (important)\n2. console → create your api key\n3. base url: http://agentrouter.org/v1\n4. pick a model and go\n\nWorks in hermes, claude code, cursor, aider and any openai-compatible tools\n\nImportant: github-only signup, older accounts get the full credit, fresh ones may get less. credits are one-time. referral adds +$100\n\nuse this before they tighten the offer",
      "raw_text": {
